Package: dabcast
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: DABodr <contact@dabordr.fr>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/DABodr/DABcast
Description: DABcast DAB+ Web UI
 Web interface for DAB+ multiplexing via ODR-mmbTools.
 Provides a browser-based control panel to manage DAB+ ensembles,
 services, audio encoding, PAD metadata and live monitoring.
Recommends: dablin, ffmpeg
Suggests: imagemagick, odr-dabmux, odr-audioenc, odr-padenc
